00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:12.440
However, when samples require both CCME, hydrocarbon fractions, and PFAS by modified EPA 537.1 or 1633,

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:18.320
the extraction and instrument blanks must be evaluated independently for each method.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:25.600
Experience practitioners know to request the full laboratory report package, including all trip

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:31.800
